# GitHub Linguist language detection overrides
# Exclude auto-generated site libs and web bundles from language stats
docs/** linguist-vendored
site_libs/** linguist-vendored
*.html linguist-vendored
*.js linguist-vendored
*.json linguist-vendored
*.css linguist-vendored
*.scss linguist-vendored

# Mark R Markdown (.Rmd) and R (.R) scripts as R
*.Rmd linguist-language=R
*.R linguist-language=R

# Quarto (.qmd) can hold either R or Python, so attribute each file to the language
# of the code it actually contains. Default to R (index.qmd and templates 01-07,
# 09-10), then override the five Python templates (08, 11-14). Later rules win.
*.qmd linguist-language=R
templates/08_vcf-mutation-analysis/template.qmd linguist-language=Python
templates/11_variant-entropy-analysis/template.qmd linguist-language=Python
templates/12_coverage-depth-analysis/template.qmd linguist-language=Python
templates/13_selection-pressure/template.qmd linguist-language=Python
templates/14_haplotype-composition/template.qmd linguist-language=Python
